  "_comment": "HywMill garrison rules (M5-G formula C3). raw = capacity * perCapacity + sum(infraBonus[role] * operational buildings of that role) + min(fortification / fortDiv, fortCap) + levyShare * adults; target = min(clamp(round(raw * typeFactors[type]), minTarget, maxTarget), maxUnits); maxUnits is the per-village tier ceiling (locked caps 24/48/72/128; there is no server-wide cap). Population is not a ceiling unless a tier sets supportRatio. Levy: baseDaily + perCapacityDaily * capacity + perTargetDaily * target points per active in-game day, capped at max(poolCap, poolCapShare * target). With levyShare/fortDiv/perTargetDaily/poolCapShare 0 and no infraBonus the formula is exactly M3's. Culture entries patch the defaults (composition replaces, tiers merge per field). M4: equipmentProvider 'hyw_profiles' is HYW's own equipment plus optional Epic Knights profiles (hywmill_equipment; identical to 'hyw' without Epic Knights). CAVALRY (light mounted scouts) is allowed from GARRISON tier and appears only in the compositions of horse-riding cultures (not Mayan or Inuit).",
